  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a ttukbaegi earthenware pot over medium heat.",
    "Add minced garlic and cook for 1 minute, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add chopped onion and cook for 3-4 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add diced bell pepper and cook for 2-3 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add chilli bean paste and cook for 1-2 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add white kidney beans, coconut cream, salt, black pepper, and ground cumin. Stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 5-7 minutes or until the sauce has thickened slightly.",
    "Stir in chopped fresh cilantro and parsley.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional cilantro and parsley if desired.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
